-- sfxnz modifications (Apache License, Version 2.0 in engine-patches/) --------
Commits and patches 0001..0023:
- 0001..0014 (M1/M2): Rebasing and unifying paged FP8 KV, DFlash2, CUDA vision,
  lazy head, CUDA graphs, and structured output onto TensorFold v1.3.5;
  parallelized 512-thread tf_ink2moe_plan, persistent window cost_cache,
  bounded verify_cache, multi-threaded checkpoint prefetch; batched DFlash2
  absorb/propose with graphed absorb/block/selector and dynamic shared draft
  guard; 8x-tiled gateUp, cp.async prompt_tc, TF_INKLING2_GATE_FP8=1,
  Blackwell RT verify TC MoE, zero-copy pool prefix_cache with batched
  tf_ink2_copy_spans, 8-warp 2x4 prompt_tc_coop, and tf_ink2moe_up_wide.
- 0015..0023 (M3): Sliding loop_ar deduplication, batched pass messages,
  1-pass RMSNorm, tiled small-M gate_down/gate_up, uint4 rel_table;
  stream-batched multi-stream conv/attn with bucketed global last_pos and
  slot-agnostic Shape graphs; Nvfp4Experts BLOCK4 repack with fused split-half
  softcap-SwiGLU and sm_121a TC prefill; lossless BF16 Tensor Core unembed
  (plus opt-in SAMPLED_FP8_HEAD=1 reusing resident FP8 lazy_head) and batched
  verify/drawRows; qmmf_group dense fusion (TF_QMMF_HALF_BN=1); uniform
  batched shared_guard with diverged priceMulti and batched hold_costs;
  distinct-token Graphs.price() fix, single-launch fused keyed DFlash2
  selector, and calibrated CHANCES + Landing; wired --drafter-bits 4 NVFP4
  draft layers; and BF16 Tensor Core tf_ink2_df_attn_batch with 16 balanced
  chunks eliminating the >=2K context decode cliff.

